      "value": "<edit>\nFollowing is worng. I missed build 1181 release note. 'multi-child behavior has been reverted back to \"Ignore\" for new components as well as DB conversions'\n</edit>\nBecause I don't know if it's an implementation bug or not, so I write this here.\nBuild 1187 release note says \"**Average** is the new default for both new PB and converted DB.\" but actual default value of newly created VRCPhysBone is Ignore.\n(checked with VRCSDK3-AVATAR-2022.04.21.03.29_Public )",
